epost_stale_job (existing per spec, 30 days) — no earlier\n  version existed in this codebase to carry forward; built fresh, reusing\n  the notify_rules row already seeded in the original Dittofeed catalog.\n- 'candidates' for a JobPosting = its Submissions (Job Board has no\n  separate JobApplication model in this codebase).\n\nMessenger:\n- notify_rules v2 put to real use: reply_to_unanswered's single row was\n  batchable for every role; now BENCH_SALES gets its own batched row while\n  the ANY default (everyone else) is instant, per the spec's two-row table.\n  TaskService.createAuto/NotifyDispatchService plumb the owner's role\n  through so the right row resolves.\n- reply_to_your_recruiter (new): the opposite direction of\n  reply_to_unanswered — a consultant nudged 4h after a recruiter/BSR\n  message goes unanswered, in-app only, uncapped, hourly cron (its window\n  is too short for the other messenger rules' nightly cadence).\n\nTests: tsc clean; 28 suites, 184 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-27T12:09:41-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/012ca746ee44e00b08c57d7dfc857f93889852a4","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-27T12:09:41-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-09-27T12:09:41-04:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20260927110000_notify_rules_job_board_v2/migration.sql","prisma/migrations/20260927120000_notify_rules_messenger_v2/migration.sql","src/cron/job-board-lifecycle.service.ts","src/cron/reply-to-your-recruiter.service.ts","src/jobs/job-board-auto-rules.module.ts","src/jobs/job-board-auto-rules.service.spec.ts","src/jobs/job-board-auto-rules.service.ts","src/tasks/auto-rules/auto-rules-messenger-v2.spec.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["src/cron/cron.module.ts","src/tasks/auto-rules/auto-rules.service.ts","src/tasks/task.service.spec.ts","src/tasks/task.service.ts"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"012ca746ee44e00b08c57d7dfc857f93889852a4","tree_id":"b117b933822285e25cb8436ceb97e25b5291629e","distinct":true,"message":"feat(notifications): Job Board lifecycle tasks + Messenger role-aware batching and reply_to_your_recruiter\n\nnotifications-module-final-spec-v2 continued (Job Board §3.1, Messenger §3.5):\n\nJob Board:\n- role_open_zero_candidates_5d (new, Employer, medium push) — a PUBLISHED\n  job with zero Submissions 5+ days after publishing.\n- role_aging_no_shortlist_14d (new, soft/panel-only, Recruiter) — a\n  PUBLISHED job with no Submission past SUBMITTED after 14 days. No\n  notify_rules row, matching the codebase's existing soft-rule convention.\n- close_or_repost_stale_job (existing per spec, 30 days) — no earlier\n  version existed in this codebase to carry forward; built fresh, reusing\n  the notify_rules row already seeded in the original Dittofeed catalog.\n- 'candidates' for a JobPosting = its Submissions (Job Board has no\n  separate JobApplication model in this codebase).\n\nMessenger:\n- notify_rules v2 put to real use: reply_to_unanswered's single row was\n  batchable for every role; now BENCH_SALES gets its own batched row while\n  the ANY default (everyone else) is instant, per the spec's two-row table.\n  TaskService.createAuto/NotifyDispatchService plumb the owner's role\n  through so the right row resolves.\n- reply_to_your_recruiter (new): the opposite direction of\n  reply_to_unanswered — a consultant nudged 4h after a recruiter/BSR\n  message goes unanswered, in-app only, uncapped, hourly cron (its window\n  is too short for the other messenger rules' nightly cadence).\n\nTests: tsc clean; 28 suites, 184 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-27T12:09:41-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/012ca746ee44e00b08c57d7dfc857f93889852a4",